			<div class="content" id="post-content-4857185">
									

<p><strong>Greenlight:</strong> yes</p>
<p><strong>Page layout:</strong> tale</p>
<p><strong>Elevator pitch:</strong> Stray dogs goes into a forest to commence a ritual involving a black dog with the unidentifiable breed to have it fed. It only comes once three weeks; when that happens, the Dark dog will choose which dog to eat based on its bravery (fending off the creature). It will attack humans, will kill them but will not eat them.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Central&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Central&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> Dr Fox observes them afore and tries to understand why these dogs are circling one particular spot, first time watching the dogs the research team had no idea about the three-week circle. So when the last day of the third week hits a giant dog appears and begins to chase the dogs around trying to find one that is stronger, all of the dogs dispersed its attacked spot where the researcher was and started to hunt them down. Dr Fox attempted to fend off the creature but was dragged under a car by three other dogs. Same with another researcher (they all hide) They hid under the car for 7 hours while the creature continues to hunt after dogs until it found one that began to bark at it, it ate the dog and disappeared back to the forest.</p>
<p>Later, Dr Fox wants to learn why one specific spot, so they dig the area and found skeletons of a man (named Damian) and a dog. Knowing this, they investigate the whole forest and learns that the bodies were murder victims. After extensive investigation, the lead points to his roommate. It said that Damian left his dorm to walk in the morning with his dog on 01/01/2014 and never returned. The roommate ends up being the one that killed Damian and the dog. While in containment, the stray dogs started to circle the site and caused containment breach, and the dark dog bites off Dr Fox’s hand (severely injuring her). And she learns that the dog and Damian’s skeletons when together were the ones that were manifesting the dark dog.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention:</strong> a little jab on the idea that dogs can sense evil spirits or something.</p>

